                    <TBODY>
                    <TR>
                      <TH>Do Your Own Kabobs</TH></TR>
                    <TR>
                      <TD>This recipe is excellent for family outings,=20
                        children's parties or 4-H get together. Each =
person can=20
                        fix the combination of their own choice and cook =
them as=20
                        desired while sharing in the fellowship of the=20
                      activity.</TD></TR>
