                        buy for cooked edible portions of:</TD>
                      <TD align=3Dmiddle colSpan=3D3>Approximate weight =
(in=20
                        pounds) to buy for 4 oz. portions of:</TD></TR>
                    <TR>
                      <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
